{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0061", "offset": 2080, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 62, "text": "事 : ▨(李宇泰, 41쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0062", "offset": 2109, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 63, "text": "▨ : 第(『新羅文字資料Ⅱ』, 194쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0063", "offset": 2110, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 64, "text": "▨ : 二(『新羅文字資料Ⅱ』, 194쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0064", "offset": 2137, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 65, "text": "昭成 : 신라 39대 왕인 소성왕(昭聖王)이며, 헌덕왕과 흥덕왕의 형이다. 이들에게 시해된 애장왕의 아버지이기도 하다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0065", "offset": 2157, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 66, "text": "▨ : 之(閔泳珪, 1962, 629쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0066", "offset": 2191, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 67, "text": "六十 : 흥덕왕의 죽은 해 나이로 추정된다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0067", "offset": 2219, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 68, "text": "己(황수영, 1999, 96쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0068", "offset": 2222, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 69, "text": "巳之歲 : 흥덕왕의 재위 기간에는 ‘巳’로 된 간지가 없으므로 헌덕왕 대에 태자로 책봉된 해를 가르키는 것으로 보기도 한다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0069", "offset": 2305, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 70, "text": "▨ : 言(閔泳珪, 1962, 629쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0070", "offset": 2355, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 71, "text": "興德 : 비석의 제액(題額)에 해당되는 부분으로 예서체로 되어 있다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0071", "offset": 2369, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 72, "text": "郞 : 即(황수영, 1999, 96쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0072", "offset": 2371, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 73, "text": "韓舍 : 신라 관등 제12위인 대사(大舍)의 다른 이름이다. 경주 월지에서 출토된 목간에도 ‘한사(韓舍)’라는 관등이 적혀 있다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0073", "offset": 2457, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 74, "text": "稟 : 禀(閔泳珪, 1962, 629쪽; 황수영, 1999, 97쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0074", "offset": 2497, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 75, "text": "歷 : 𠪾(황수영, 1999 97쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0075", "offset": 2523, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 76, "text": "嶷 : ▨(황수영, 1999 97쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0076", "offset": 2560, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 77, "text": "泰 : {夫+小}(황수영, 1999, 98쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0077", "offset": 2561, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 78, "text": "寺 : 等(崔鉛植, 425쪽; 황수영, 1999, 98쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0080_gskh_005_0010_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0080_0020_0078", "offset": 2562, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 79, "text": "頌 : 領(崔鉛植, 425쪽; 황수영, 1999, 98쪽)", "type": "각주"}
